{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122399","id":4277507736,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7-9ZaY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122399","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122399.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122399.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122399","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122399/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122399/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122399/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ed38f119101e3cb4e6ac744a65844ee13b6c0579","number":122399,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add editor settings `localize_editor` and `localize_documentation`","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/77\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13728\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- Adds new editor settings to `localize_editor` and `localize_documentation` separately.\r\n  - `localize_editor` applies to the editor and project manager.\r\n  - `localize_documentation` applies to the offline doc and tooltips.\r\n  - Changing these two settings currently requires a restart (see PR 102562).\r\n\r\nScreenshots:\r\n<img width=\"565\" height=\"279\" alt=\"Image 2026-08-14_15-42-17\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c331556-da9b-4781-bfcf-8736826a77b0\" />\r\n\r\n(Note: I chose `uk` for testing because it is 100% translated on [Webslate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/godot-engine/).)\r\n| `en` Editor, `uk` Doc | `uk` Editor, `en` Doc |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"1280\" height=\"764\" alt=\"Image 2026-08-14_02-51-37\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/141cfe13-3a62-40a6-9add-9ad4c7281abd\" /> | <img width=\"1280\" height=\"764\" alt=\"Image 2026-08-14_02-49-29\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c46f5a7-cea6-4af9-8326-0d10177be689\" /> |\r\n\r\nNotes for reviewers:\r\n- The same language is used for both the offline doc and tooltips for consistency.\r\n- The offline doc is updated without a restart, but the tooltips (currently) are not, so changing `localize_documentation` requires a restart (for now).\r\n- A localization toggle is preferred over a separate language dropdown menu (see [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13728#issuecomment-5083185775)).\r\n- `localize_properties` is not added because `localize_settings` and `default_property_name_style` serve the same purpose.\r\n- Resolved. ~Not sure if:~\r\n  - ~adding helper functions (e.g. in `TranslationServer`) is needed?~\r\n  - ~updating existing functions (e.g. `EditorSettings::get_language()`) is needed?~\r\n  - ~subheadings (e.g. \"Class\", \"Description\") & labels (e.g. \"Deprecated\") should follow the doc's locale (instead of the editor's locale)?~\r\n\r\n## Author disclosure\r\n\r\nI wrote this PR by myself.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht